/E (Against this backdrop, the Fund's underlying fundamentals remain solid. This month's dip in performance is structural and one-off, tied to the scale and timing of refinancing activity rather than any deterioration in asset quality or pipeline depth. The strategy's short-duration, self-liquidating, zero-leverage characteristics continue to insulate the portfolio from broader market volatility, and the Fund remains well positioned to redeploy capital efficiently across its core SME, receivables, and consumer credit verticals.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [28]
